      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "할아버지,\n내 단칼빙이 요즘 기운이 없어.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n회복시켜 줘도 상태가 나아지질 않아.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D560C544BC84C9C0002C000AB0B40020B2E8CE7CBE59C7740020C694C9980020AE30C6B4C7740020C5C6C5B4002E00100001BE00000AD68CBCF5C2DCCF1C0020C918B3C40020C0C1D0DCAC000020B098C544C9C0C9C80020C54AC544002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "허허... 그건 말이다,\n칼날이 무뎌져서 그런 거란다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5C8D5C8002E002E002E0020ADF8AC740020B9D0C774B2E4002C000ACE7CB0A0C7740020BB34B38CC838C11C0020ADF8B7F00020AC70B780B2E40021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 어떻게 해야 해?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020D574C57C0020D574003F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도검포켓몬 단칼빙의 칼날을\n다시 예리하게 만들기 위해 필요한 건 바로...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4AC80D3ECCF13BAAC0020B2E8CE7CBE59C7580020CE7CB0A0C744000AB2E4C2DC0020C608B9ACD558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4AE300020C704D5740020D544C694D55C0020AC740020BC14B85C002E002E002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데기라스!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370AE30B77CC2A40021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게 무슨 소리야!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C0020BB34C2A80020C18CB9ACC57C0021003F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단단한 데기라스의 몸을\n몇 번이고 베다 보면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n단칼빙의 칼날이 다시 예리해질 게다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8B2E8D55C0020B370AE30B77CC2A4C7580020BAB8C744000ABA870020BC88C774ACE00020BCA0B2E40020BCF4BA7400100001BE00000AB2E8CE7CBE59C7580020CE7CB0A0C7740020B2E4C2DC0020C608B9ACD574C9C80020AC8CB2E40021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "진짜...?\n하지만 데기라스를 갑자기 어디서 구하지...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C4C9DC002E002E002E003F000AD558C9C0B9CC0020B370AE30B77CC2A4B97C0020AC11C790AE300020C5B4B514C11C0020AD6CD558C9C0002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗! 있잖아!\n혹시 데기라스를 잡은 적 있어?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n있으면 내 단칼빙과 승부해 주라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55700210020C788C796C5440021000AD639C2DC0020B370AE30B77CC2A4B97C0020C7A1C7400020C8010020C788C5B4003F00100001BE00000AC788C73CBA740020B0B40020B2E8CE7CBE59ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCB77C002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지닌 포켓몬에 데기라스 1마리만 넣고\n내 단칼빙과 승부해 주라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B370AE30B77CC2A400200031B9C8B9ACB9CC0020B123ACE0000AB0B40020B2E8CE7CBE59ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCB77C002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단단한 데기라스의 몸을\n몇 번이고 베다 보면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n단칼빙의 칼날이 다시 예리해질 게다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8B2E8D55C0020B370AE30B77CC2A4C7580020BAB8C744000ABA870020BC88C774ACE00020BCA0B2E40020BCF4BA7400100001BE00000AB2E8CE7CBE59C7580020CE7CB0A0C7740020B2E4C2DC0020C608B9ACD574C9C80020AC8CB2E40021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데기라스를 데리고 있구나!\n내 단칼빙과 승부해 줄 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370AE30B77CC2A4B97C0020B370B9ACACE00020C788AD6CB0980021000AB0B40020B2E8CE7CBE59ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020C9040020AC70C57C003F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇구나...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD6CB098002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아싸!\n그럼, 바로 승부하자!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C2F80021000AADF8B7FC002C0020BC14B85C0020C2B9BD80D558C790002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "졌네...\n단칼빙, 바로 회복시켜 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C84CB124002E002E002E000AB2E8CE7CBE59002C0020BC14B85C0020D68CBCF5C2DCCF1C0020C904AC8C002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어라? 단칼빙의 기운이 돌아왔잖아!\n할아버지 말이 진짜였어! 굉장하다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B77C003F0020B2E8CE7CBE59C7580020AE30C6B4C7740020B3CCC544C654C796C5440021000AD560C544BC84C9C00020B9D0C7740020C9C4C9DCC600C5B400210020AD49C7A5D558B2E4002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "허허~!\n이 할아버지가 말한 대로지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5C8D5C8007E0021000AC7740020D560C544BC84C9C0AC000020B9D0D55C0020B300B85CC9C0003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 데기라스가 있어야 한다니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020B370AE30B77CC2A4AC000020C788C5B4C57C0020D55CB2E4B2C8AE4C0021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 이건\n데기라스에게도 좋은 일이란다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC38ACE0B85C0020C774AC74000AB370AE30B77CC2A4C5D0AC8CB3C40020C88BC7400020C77CC774B780B2E4002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "몸이 얼마나 단단해졌는지 확인함으로써\n안심하고 진화할 수 있게 되거든!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAB8C7740020C5BCB9C8B0980020B2E8B2E8D574C84CB294C9C00020D655C778D568C73CB85CC368000AC548C2ECD558ACE00020C9C4D654D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020B418AC70B4E00021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭔가 지어낸 이야기 같은데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB54AC000020C9C0C5B4B0B80020C774C57CAE300020AC19C740B370002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼 단칼빙의\n기운이 돌아와서 다행이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC0020B2E8CE7CBE59C758000AAE30C6B4C7740020B3CCC544C640C11C0020B2E4D589C774C57C002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 데기라스도 단칼빙이\n기운을 되찾는 걸 도와줘서 정말 고마워!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B3C40020B370AE30B77CC2A4B3C40020B2E8CE7CBE59C774000AAE30C6B4C7440020B418CC3EB2940020AC780020B3C4C640C918C11C0020C815B9D00020ACE0B9C8C6CC002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의외의 방식으로 서로에게 도움을 주는\n포켓몬이 분명 더 있을 게다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
